# The CI case serves the M3.1 image cell of models_atomesh.yaml in place of the
# profile's server: the cell's arguments and environment, with
# USE_ATOMESH_ENTRYPOINTS=1 as atomesh-accuracy-validation.yaml serves a model.
# The standalone service names the model by its path.
CELL_LAUNCH=$(python3 "$HERE/checks/ci_case.py" launch "$MODEL_PATH" "$ATOM_NODE") ||
  { report "ci-case launch refused"; exit 1; }
eval "$CELL_LAUNCH"
SERVED_MODEL=$MODEL_PATH
